      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Now, about *you*... ::He hands you 700 stygian coins.:: Here. Yer share of the loot.

Ya did us a massive favor, $(#jack/lady). Wouldn't have done it without ya. Consider yerself our ally, and know we got yer back when yer out there on the streets of Junkyard.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
