    <unit id="=&gt;q50" name="=&gt;q50">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">100</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I do. ::He chuckles.:: But I can't know everyone, $(#jack/lady). Maybe... this Chester of yours prefers dealin' with the Scappers and doesn't come over.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a51" name="=&gt;a51">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">102</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Tell me about Old Junkyard.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q52" name="=&gt;q52">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">104</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>"Old Junkyard", "Depot A". It's the original junkyard this town was built next to from the scrap our predecessors found there. It's a restricted area now, though, on account of some accident with a mutagen tank that happened a long time ago.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q53" name="=&gt;q53">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">106</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's a crazy zone now: rabid dogs, mutants, flipped-out auto-turrets...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q54" name="=&gt;q54">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">108</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>There's still lots of valuable junk there, though, &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q55" name="=&gt;q55">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">110</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>and thanks to yer help, the gates leadin' to it are now under our control.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q56" name="=&gt;q56">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">112</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>and ya got Scrappers still doin' raids there. And they ain't lettin' many other folks get in. 

That's the problem, ya see - those bastards control the gate. It's in their freakin' base.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a57" name="=&gt;a57">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">114</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm sure there's another way in.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new"/>
